  {\n      \"text\": \"The stream name cannot contain arbitrary symbols.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"The stream name cannot contain arbitrary symbols\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Stream names containing a dot (for example, `checkout.web`) and other characters are refused by Nimbrel Probe.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"Stream names containing a dot (for example, `checkout.web`) and other characters are refused by Nimbrel Probe\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Stream names are validated against the pattern below before the agent registers.\",\n      \"line\": 10,\n      \"span\": \"Stream names are validated against the pattern below before the agent registers\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Only letters, digits, spaces and hyphens are accepted.\",\n      \"line\": 10,\n      \"span\": \"Only letters, digits, spaces and hyphens are accepted\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Anything else causes the agent to refuse to start.\",\n      \"line\": 10,\n      \"span\": \"anything else causes the agent to refuse to start\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Stream names are validated against ^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$ before the agent registers.\",\n      \"line\": 13,\n      \"span\": \"Stream names are validated against ^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$ before the agent registers\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"One customer wanted to keep a stream name exactly as it stood.\",\n      \"line\": 18,\n      \"span\": \"One customer wanted to keep a stream name exactly as it stood\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"That stream name string was the customer's product name in use throughout the customer's organization.\",\n      \"line\": 18,\n      \"span\": \"that string was their product name in use throughout their organization\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The customer's reporting depended on that stream name.\",\n      \"line\": 18,\n      \"span\": \"their reporting depended on it\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"If the stream is renamed to contain only supported symbols, the Nimbrel Probe agent will register.\",\n      \"line\": 26,\n      \"span\": \"Rename the stream to contain only supported symbols so the Nimbrel Probe agent will register\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A global tag allows each trace to maintain a link between the original name and the renamed name.\",\n      \"line\": 26,\n      \"span\": \"which allows each trace to maintain a link between the original name and the renamed one\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":84411,"type":"result","duration_ms":87729,"uuid":"ea69b2ba-8a97-45f1-a45e-50cacff401c0","ttft_stream_ms":2181,"time_to_request_ms":97,"first_content_frame_ms":2181,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
